    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>In Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Burning Boats Studios</strong>, an independent game development team based in Mexico. We're thrilled to announce <strong>Mindaro</strong>, our ambitious project currently in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1755543348\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small, dedicated team, our passion is to craft an engaging and polished gaming experience that resonates with a wide audience. We believe in creating games that are not only fun to play but also contribute positively to the gaming community we're proud to be a part of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your</strong> <strong>feedback</strong> is invaluable to us. We openly welcome any questions, suggestions, or constructive criticism as we continue to refine Mindaro. Thank you for following our progress; your support means the world. If you haven't already, please consider adding Mindaro to your <strong>wishlist</strong> \u2013 it truly helps us on our journey to launch a game we believe everyone will enjoy.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1755543348\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5a2fe6b2dee1d96f4fa3dcaed8cde63a.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/0adc7e1d17e4724803cd3d07b3c8725e.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by how everything looks; it has survived this long for a reason, and it's waiting for you to come down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/25aef4eaceef2690507a71083e2cd77b.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to explore, learn everything you can to help future Pioneers with the knowledge to conquer the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/21a9559f8d684042c938bd6690d4d6cc.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base \u2013 the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1755543348\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5a2fe6b2dee1d96f4fa3dcaed8cde63a.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/f4f7a3212948d164e42fa8941822f264.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/0adc7e1d17e4724803cd3d07b3c8725e.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by how everything looks; it has survived this long for a reason, and it's waiting for you to come down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/750ac2332df6dd9227da6ff4294dc100.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/25aef4eaceef2690507a71083e2cd77b.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to explore, learn everything you can to help future Pioneers with the knowledge to conquer the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/fa2bdd62d2f0859c041f57929215d244.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/21a9559f8d684042c938bd6690d4d6cc.avif?t=1755543348\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base \u2013 the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.poster.avif?t=1755543348\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.webm?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ed88294044ae53923cb49486ae488fda.mp4?t=1755543348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
